 <strong>co-op</strong> or <strong>split-screen battle</strong> game modes. All within the ever-changing beautifully illuminated depths of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/816fc89d2a8a856411f1cea6de525465.avif?t=1768496947\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras_big/816fc89d2a8a856411f1cea6de525465.webp?t=1768496947 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/62f4a8843032673063b829c93d683513.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aluna Rift</strong> is a challenging arcade space shooter with precise controls and randomized roguelite runs. It features solo, co-op and split-screen PVP game modes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Aluna Rift</strong> is a neon-coated love letter to classic arcade gaming fused with modern mechanics and polished for endless replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/c5beabf329b70e5979c5aeba0f4e3249.poster.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/c5beabf329b70e5979c5aeba0f4e3249.webm?t=1768496947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/182992