store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/4b64bf70628e83b97831707ad81c09c8.mp4?t=1768496947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/25059ca846da04fefd89cdcdf05cfd5a.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Embark on your journey with a friend or battle them head to head. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/ef14b683dc5afa8b89364ef01da8e030.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/91a409bdcb62418732ffeeab44ac1dd1.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Rift-Warp through time and space in search of your prey. Ever-changing vibrant galaxies and randomized waves of enemies means an endless exploration of deep space. No two runs are the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1829920/extras/86dd2efea70367d195d2659178e96714.avif?t=1768496947\" width=640 height=30 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat Upgrades</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random Encounter Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless Survival Mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level Up Your Ship</p></li><l